;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#ecfccb;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1138" y="276" width="472" height="126" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_operator_properties" value="&lt;b&gt;operator_properties&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;운영자 ↔ 숙소 배정 · 연결 테이블&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;b&gt;* operator_id : uuid  ● PK ◆ FK → operators&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;* property_id : text  ● PK ◆ FK → property_cleaning_config&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;… 그 밖의 칼럼 1개&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2781" y="276" width="446" height="108" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_cleaning_jobs" value="&lt;b&gt;cleaning_jobs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;청소 일정 (상태머신)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;b&gt;* id : uuid  ● PK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;property_id : text  ◆ FK → property_cleaning_config ◆ FK → property_reservations ◇ UQ(복합)&lt;br/&gt;reservation_uid : text (null)  ◆ FK → property_reservations&lt;br/&gt;checkout_at : timestamp with time zone  ◇ UQ(복합)&lt;br/&gt;assigned_cleaner_id : uuid (null)  ◆ FK → cleaners&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;… 그 밖의 칼럼 11개&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="530" width="681" height="162" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_cleaning_notifs" value="&lt;b&gt;cleaning_notifs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;알림 발송 내역 · 연결 테이블&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;b&gt;* id : uuid  ● PK&lt;/b&g